#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.parallel.rst:2
#: 1a82c3af2a524dd98773b230f2cb0b86
msgid "pybroker.parallel module"
msgstr "pybroker.parallel 模块"

#: bf2dd488f2ab427c8d7b50addca05d91 of pybroker.parallel:1
msgid "Contains parallel execution configuration."
msgstr "包含并行执行配置。"

#: 811e5594c4e947e8aeef34a5145e99a5 of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig:1
msgid "Configuration for parallel execution used by PyBroker."
msgstr "PyBroker 使用的并行执行配置。"

#: 6a10fa73976b48789bac4b3413173681 of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig:3
msgid ""
"PyBroker can compute indicators, train models, and run optimizations in "
"parallel using `joblib <https://joblib.readthedocs.io/>`_. Optimization "
"trials run on all available cores by default; indicator computation and "
"model training additionally require their ``parallel_indicators``/ "
"``parallel_models`` flags. Call ``set_parallel(n_jobs=1)`` to run "
"everything sequentially, and read the current configuration with "
":func:`get_parallel_config`."
msgstr ""
"PyBroker 可以使用 `joblib <https://joblib.readthedocs.io/>`_ "
"并行计算指标、训练模型和运行优化。默认情况下，优化试验会使用所有可用核心运行；指标计算和模型训练还需要分别设置 "
"``parallel_indicators``/``parallel_models`` 标志。调用 "
"``set_parallel(n_jobs=1)`` 可使所有操作按顺序运行，使用 :func:`get_parallel_config` "
"可读取当前配置。"

#: 4b3f347407014552a998394e8ecd4a65 of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig:13
msgid ""
"Number of worker jobs. ``-1`` (the default) uses all available cores; "
"``1`` runs sequentially."
msgstr "工作进程（worker）的数量。 ``-1`` （默认值）使用所有可用核心； ``1`` 表示按顺序运行。"

#: 0c0bfb642c5142a8bd7abc77a2c4c5f6 1cf217179cde4477b39f4d97a02394cd
#: 2d109f5ad0f24a6aa71aab2bae3b106f of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig
msgid "type"
msgstr "类型"

#: a6320d16c7b14a2eaaaf2045cc377dd8 of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig:16
msgid "int | None"
msgstr "int | None"

#: c2321c0941214a5bb7b9d9d37cbbfe29 of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig:20
msgid ""
"joblib backend name. ``'loky'`` (the default) runs work in separate "
"processes. Any backend registered with joblib is also accepted (e.g. "
"``'ray'`` after ``ray.util.joblib.register_ray()``)."
msgstr ""
"joblib 后端名称。 ``'loky'`` （默认值）会在独立的进程中运行任务。任何已在 joblib 中注册的后端也都可以使用（例如在调用 "
"``ray.util.joblib.register_ray()`` 后使用 ``'ray'``）。"

#: 92c830a6b3ec4982b290584a3c0df815 of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig:24
msgid "str | None"
msgstr "str | None"

#: f19ba8358fa5470aa0a9354ddc7452f9 of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig:28
msgid ""
"Optional pre-constructed :class:`joblib.Parallel` instance that overrides"
" ``n_jobs`` and ``backend`` entirely. When set, PyBroker uses it directly"
" and the caller owns its lifecycle. Defaults to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"可选的、预先构建好的 :class:`joblib.Parallel` 实例，会完全覆盖 ``n_jobs`` 和 "
"``backend``。设置后，PyBroker 会直接使用该实例，其生命周期由调用方负责管理。默认为 ``None``。"

#: 7e3f8838dc754f1c9f8bdc24076b01ce of pybroker.parallel.ParallelConfig:33
msgid "joblib.parallel.Parallel | None"
msgstr "joblib.parallel.Parallel | None"

#: bea74399c31542088e32bc095799eb70 of pybroker.parallel.get_parallel_config:1
msgid "Returns the current parallel configuration"
msgstr "返回当前的并行配置"

#: 729fbb7b85974ef784389f25dfddecb9 of pybroker.parallel.set_parallel:1
msgid "Configures parallel execution used by PyBroker."
msgstr "配置 PyBroker 使用的并行执行方式。"

#: 6401dc85f44b44e5a0551aeee8974f16 of pybroker.parallel.set_parallel:3
msgid ""
"PyBroker uses all available cores by default; call "
"``set_parallel(n_jobs=1)`` to run sequentially."
msgstr "PyBroker 默认使用所有可用核心；调用 ``set_parallel(n_jobs=1)`` 可按顺序运行。"

#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.parallel.rst
#: ca9b95b4f8ed4cde959860cca0b1265f
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ec1ef33bbba6488eab09f2a0130ed470 of pybroker.parallel.set_parallel:6
msgid ""
"Number of workers. ``-1`` uses all cores (the default); ``1`` runs "
"sequentially. Leave as ``None`` to keep the currently configured value."
msgstr "工作进程的数量。 ``-1`` 使用所有核心（默认值）； ``1`` 表示按顺序运行。保留为 ``None`` 则维持当前已配置的值。"

#: 3d4e9f6b0a244a639dc89c07d41a174c of pybroker.parallel.set_parallel:9
msgid ""
"joblib backend name: ``'loky'`` (default) or any backend registered via "
":func:`joblib.register_parallel_backend` (e.g. ``'ray'`` after "
"``ray.util.joblib.register_ray()``). The ``'multiprocessing'`` backend is"
" rejected because its standard pickle serialization cannot ship "
"PyBroker's dispatch closures."
msgstr ""
"joblib 后端名称： ``'loky'`` （默认值），或通过 "
":func:`joblib.register_parallel_backend` 注册的任意后端（例如在调用 "
"``ray.util.joblib.register_ray()`` 后使用 ``'ray'``）。 ``'multiprocessing'`` "
"后端会被拒绝，因为其标准 pickle 序列化机制无法传递 PyBroker 的调度闭包。"

#: 40aab51d04bc45e3a1070573b53fe44e of pybroker.parallel.set_parallel:14
msgid ""
"Pre-constructed :class:`joblib.Parallel` instance. Mutually exclusive "
"with ``n_jobs``/``backend``; caller owns its lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"预先构建好的 :class:`joblib.Parallel` 实例。与 ``n_jobs``/``backend`` "
"互斥；其生命周期由调用方负责管理。"

#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.parallel.rst
#: d020f6052afe4c8199e6e7f86fe208ea
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "引发"

#: 6b1b362da9d745dfa2a46bf38d084bc9 of pybroker.parallel.set_parallel:17
msgid ""
"If ``parallel`` is passed together with ``n_jobs`` or     ``backend``, if"
" ``backend`` is not a registered joblib backend or     is "
"``'multiprocessing'``, or if ``parallel`` returns results out     of "
"submission order."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``parallel`` 与 ``n_jobs`` 或 ``backend`` 一同传入；如果 ``backend`` 不是已注册的 "
"joblib 后端，或为 ``'multiprocessing'``；或者 ``parallel`` 返回的结果顺序与提交顺序不一致。"

